    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this story-driven art game, you\u2019ll follow Mitch, who\u2019s just moved to a strange new planet. Join her as she settles in \u2014 starting a new job, exploring the city, and meeting all kinds of interesting folk.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the city!\u00a0</strong>Jump on the subway and discover each unique neighborhood.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet new friends!</strong>\u00a0Develop relationships with a variety of unusual characters.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work for a spider chef!</strong> Grind away at your new job - serving sandwiches to flies.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315010/extras/52398618e77aeea21d17727cf02e3f20.poster.avif?t=1744737454\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315010/extras/52398618e77aeea21d17727cf02e3f20.webp?t=1744737454\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=104 /></picture></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Settle in for a heartwarming and introspective story</strong>. Watch Mitch as she grows and adapts to her new life. Face challenges, solve problems, and learn lessons as events unfold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy open-world freedom grounded by a linear journey.</strong> Join Mitch for a week in her life. Each day is full of potential!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100% indie.\u00a0</strong>This is a two-dev project with hand-drawn artwork and an original soundtrack.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this story-driven art game, you\u2019ll follow Mitch, who\u2019s just moved to a strange new planet. Join her as she settles in \u2014 starting a new job, exploring the city, and meeting all kinds of interesting folk.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the city!\u00a0</strong>Jump on the subway and discover each unique neighborhood.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet new friends!</strong>\u00a0Develop relationships with a variety of unusual characters.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work for a spider chef!</strong> Grind away at your new job - serving sandwiches to flies.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315010/extras/52398618e77aeea21d17727cf02e3f20.poster.avif?t=1744737454\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315010/extras/52398618e77aeea21d17727cf02e3f20.webp?t=1744737454\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=104 /></picture></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Settle in for a heartwarming and introspective story</strong>. Watch Mitch as she grows and adapts to her new life. Face challenges, solve problems, and learn lessons as events unfold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy open-world freedom grounded by a linear journey.</strong> Join Mitch for a week in her life. Each day is full of potential!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100% indie.\u00a0</strong>This is a two-dev project with hand-drawn artwork and an original soundtrack.</p></li></ul>",
